## Live v0.1 known limitation

`AudioMixer.useEnginePath = false` — v0.2 AVAudioEngine real-mix
path is written but has an unsolved buffer-drop issue. Default
preset is `.sysOnly` until v0.2 mixer is fixed (see
`Sources/Core/Encoding/AudioMixer.swift` "KNOWN ISSUE" comment in
the sibling repo).
